---
import { NEPAL } from '../../config/site';
---
<section class="section surface" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <h2>Five products from one company</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Ninja Infosys LLC builds and runs eShasan, ePahichan, AirFone, LunaIoT and LunaCam. Each one has its own site, its own users and its own roadmap, and we choose where to invest next across all five.</p>
      <p>In Nepal we operate through {NEPAL.legalName}, a Nepal-registered private limited company.</p>
      <p><a href="/about">More about us</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .surface { background: var(--surface); }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr; gap: var(--space-8); align-items: start; }
  .section > .wrap > h2:first-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-5); } }
</style>
